'''HI-DO''' (ハイドゥ, Haidou) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = HI-DO
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 196.png
|money drop = 2,100¢ - 8,295¢
}}

==Enemy==
Pretty much a shorter ranged but heavier hitting [[JUPITER KING (Enemy)|JUPITER KING]], posing high health, damage, and range.

==Strategy==
HI-DO can greatly weaken the presence of frail backliners, but its slow attack rate provides a wide window of opportunity for faster attackers with less range (such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]). The use of [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] is advised to exploit its Floating trait.

